guide forever/class/druid/cure-poison
title Cure Poison
category Class
folder Druid
keywords Cure Poison, Lessons Anew, The Principal Source, Gathering the Cure, Curing the Sick, Power over Poison, Sickly Deer, Sickly Gazelle, Moonglade, class quest
reward spell 8946 "Cure Poison"
reward item 15866
why Cure Poison is no longer trained in Forever: this chain teaches it, with a medicine bag on the way.
class Druid
levels 14-20
zone Moonglade

# Cure Poison: in Forever the spell is no longer trained, Power over Poison
# (6125 Night Elf, 6130 Tauren) rewards it (Wowhead Forever's druid class
# page: "Rewards: adds Cure Poison").
# - Night Elves: Lessons Anew (6121, Mathrengyl Bearwalker) -> Dendrite
#   Starblaze in Moonglade -> The Principal Source (6122: fill the sampler at
#   Cliffspring Falls) -> Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine: Gathering the
#   Cure (6123: 5 Earthroot, 12 Lunar Fungus) and Curing the Sick (6124: ten
#   Sickly Deer) -> Dendrite -> Power over Poison (6125) back to Mathrengyl.
# - Tauren: Lessons Anew (6126, Turak Runetotem) -> Dendrite -> The Principal
#   Source (6127: Dreadmist Peak) -> Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads:
#   Gathering the Cure (6128: 5 Earthroot, 5 Kodo Horns) and Curing the Sick
#   (6129: ten Sickly Gazelles) -> Dendrite -> Power over Poison (6130) back
#   to Turak.
# Earthroot needs Herbalism to pick (the quest text says so); herb vendors
# sell it in limited stock (Wowhead Forever, item 2449: Maria Lumere in
# Stormwind six at a time, Hula'mahi at the Crossroads three), else the
# Auction House.
# Skyborne: Forever added Lessons Anew givers beside both Skyborne landings
# (Alfina Nightgaze west of Dalaran, Hana Lighthoof in northern Mulgore), but
# the data offered the rest of the chain to Night Elves and Tauren only.
# Wowhead Forever opens the Alliance chain (6121-6125) to Skyborne druids
# (corrections.json, checked 2026-10-16); this guide has no Skyborne steps
# yet.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie
# 12.1.0, Forever); Wowhead Forever quest 6123 (the Lunar Fungal Blooms grow in
# the moonkin caves east of Auberdine) and item 2449 (Earthroot vendors).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Night Elves

step Lessons Anew
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave.
  level 14
  accept 6121 npc 4217                  -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only NightElf
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Then fly to Auberdine.
  turnin 6121                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6122
  fly "Auberdine"

step Cliffspring Falls
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  tip Ride north-east from Auberdine to Cliffspring Falls and fill the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler at the mouth of the cave by the falls.
  collect 15845 quest 6122.1            -- Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler

step Alanndarian Nightsong
  only NightElf
  tip Back in Auberdine.
  turnin 6122                           -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  accept 6123

step Lunar Fungus and Earthroot
  only NightElf
  tip The Lunar Fungal Blooms grow in the moonkin caves in the hills just east of Auberdine; the moonkin there are irritable. Earthroot needs Herbalism: herbalists pick it all over Darkshore, anyone else buys it from Maria Lumere (Alchemy Supplies) in Stormwind or on the Auction House.
  collect 15851 x12 quest 6123.2        -- Lunar Fungus
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6123.1          -- Earthroot

step Alanndarian Nightsong
  only NightElf
  turnin 6123                           -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  accept 6124

step Sickly Deer
  only NightElf
  tip Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Deer. They roam Darkshore from the Cliffspring River in the north to the Ashenvale border in the south.
  kill 12298 quest 6124.1               -- Sickly Deer: use the salve on them

step Curing the Sick
  only NightElf
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then fly to Rut'theran Village and take the portal up to Darnassus.
  turnin 6124                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6125
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Power over Poison
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 6125                           -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cure Poison

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren

step Lessons Anew
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Turak Runetotem stands on Elder Rise.
  level 14
  accept 6126 npc 3033                  -- Turak Runetotem

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only Tauren
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Bunthen Plainswind flies druids to Thunder Bluff; fly on to the Crossroads from there.
  turnin 6126                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6127
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Dreadmist Peak
  only Tauren
  zone The Barrens
  tip From the Crossroads ride north to Dreadmist Peak and fill the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler at the Dreadmist Peak Pool.
  fly "Crossroads"
  collect 15843 quest 6127.1            -- Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler

step Tonga Runetotem
  only Tauren
  tip Tonga Runetotem stands in the Crossroads. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi, a few steps away, sells Earthroot, three at a time until he restocks.
  turnin 6127                           -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6128
  buy 2449 x5 npc 3490 optional         -- Earthroot; herbalists pick it on the plains

step Earthroot and Kodo Horns
  only Tauren
  tip Lost Barrens Kodos roam the plains north and west of the Crossroads and around the Stagnant Oasis; each drops a horn. Herbalists find Earthroot all over the northern Barrens.
  collect 15852 x5 quest 6128.2         -- Kodo Horn
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6128.1          -- Earthroot

step Tonga Runetotem
  only Tauren
  turnin 6128                           -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6129

step Sickly Gazelles
  only Tauren
  tip Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Gazelles: they graze north of the road that runs east and west through the Crossroads.
  kill 12296 quest 6129.1               -- Sickly Gazelle: use the salve on them

step Curing the Sick
  only Tauren
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff.
  turnin 6129                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6130
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Power over Poison
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 6130                           -- Turak Runetotem: Cure Poison
